Naval cameos are judged against the Naval queue and the Naval Yard.

Tab 3 lists Vehicle, Naval and Aircraft items but draw_sidebar greyed each cameo with the
queue state and factory of ONE category (the first busy one, else Vehicle), so every ship
was dark until a War Factory stood (and a tank in production darkened them). Each cameo
now uses its own category queue and factory, and its production clock too.
rulesmd: ships need only their yard chain (GAYARD/NAYARD/YAYARD + TECH/RADAR), never a War Factory.

